                <mxCell id="64" value="&lt;b&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(102, 0, 102));&quot;&gt;1. Notification is something that comes Outside of our application, even when our applicaiton is not running&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" parent="3" vertex="1">
