                <mxCell id="91" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;returns a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; color: rgb(192, 192, 192); background-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); scrollbar-color: rgb(75, 75, 75) rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot; class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;410 Gone &lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(192, 192, 192); scrollbar-color: rgb(75, 75, 75) rgb(27, 29, 30); background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 51, 102));&quot;&gt;(if google know url is not present in the google api databsae&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt; or &lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;font-family: Helvetica; color: rgb(192, 192, 192); background-color: rgb(38, 38, 38); scrollbar-color: rgb(75, 75, 75) rgb(27, 29, 30);&quot; class=&quot;bg-text-200/5 border border-0.5 border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1 py-px text-[0.9rem]&quot;&gt;404 Not Found (&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(192, 192, 192); scrollbar-color: rgb(75, 75, 75) rgb(27, 29, 30); background-color: light-dark(rgb(255, 255, 255), rgb(0, 153, 153));&quot;&gt;url is present in the google api database, but the browser instance, never suceeded with response&lt;/span&gt;)&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt; from FCM.&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;rotatable=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;dashed=1;dashPattern=1 4;" parent="73" vertex="1">
